@startuml
title W2 — SO28 / CO28 Find eligible waitlisted patients
skinparam shadowing false
actor "Administrative Staff" as Staff
participant ":AppointmentTrackingSystem" as System
Staff -> System : findEligibleWaitlistedPatients(slot, medicalService)
alt known OPEN slot; service supported
  alt one or more eligible entries
    System --> Staff : candidate details in priority order
  else no eligible entries
    System --> Staff : empty candidate list
  end
else slot unknown/occupied or service invalid
  System --> Staff : rejection reason; refresh selection
end
note over System
  Query only: no offer, reservation or booking.
  Matching, patient/referral and resource rules: CO28.
end note
@enduml
